First, we open a browser.
And type an URL(https://github.com/Assignment) on a search bar and press enter.
then browser check the URL IP address first in its cheche and if its not found then ask for the IP address from the DNS system.
DNS(DOMAIN NAME SYSTEM) convert the domain name in to IP address.
then browser connects with web server through that IP address.
now browser sends request to the web server .
Then ,web server process it and respond to the browser in the required file( html, css, javascript ).
Browser will execute the respond and display the output. 
